SMU Masters Coffee Sessions December 2026<ul><li value="1" dir="ltr"><b><strong>When:</strong></b> Every Monday, Wednesday, and Friday from 2 to 23 December 2026</li><li value="2" dir="ltr"><b><strong>Time:</strong></b> 10.00am–1.00pm and 3.00pm–6.00pm (Singapore time)</li><li value="3" dir="ltr"><b><strong>Format:</strong></b> 30 minutes, one-to-one, on campus or online</li></ul>Choosing the right master's programme is a big step. Book a 30-minute one-to-one chat with our SMU team to find the SMU Masters programme that fits your career goals, get feedback on your profile, and ask about admissions, scholarships, and life in Singapore.
&nbsp;
Slots are limited. We will email the meeting point or Zoom link to confirmed attendees.
